# Sioona Architecture

Next.js app in `web/` + FastAPI Signal Score service in `backend/`. No `packages/`. Do not apply parent Expo RN rules.

## Stack (current ≠ target)

| Layer | Current (code) | Do not assume until asked |
|-------|----------------|---------------------------|
| App | Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, Tailwind, Geist (`web/`) | — |
| API | FastAPI Signal Score (`backend/`) | Auth0-gated multi-tenant API |
| Detect | Keyword heuristics (`detect.ts`) + optional Groq Qwen pass 2 (`detect-llm.ts`, `DETECT_LLM=1`) | vLLM / LangGraph / QLoRA |
| Data | JSON file store for chats/messages/taxonomy (`store.ts`) + **Neon** for SignalScore + Shadow Mode queue + dual-written conversations/messages + conversation `ground_truth` | Full Neon chat SoT + taxonomy + pgvector |
| Auth | None (`X-Tenant-Id` header to backend) | Auth0 |

**Signal Score + pending queue SoT:** FastAPI + Neon (`backend/`). Insights pending list uses `GET …/needs-review` joined to JSON signals for evidence. JSON `reviewPrecision` is a legacy mirror when the backend is unreachable.

## Layout

- `web/src/app/` — routes + `api/` (BFF to FastAPI for feedback/score)
- `web/src/components/` — UI (`"use client"` only when interactive)
- `web/src/lib/` — domain logic (prefer edits here); `backend-client.ts` talks to FastAPI
- `web/src/data/fixtures/` — seed demo data
- `web/data/` — runtime store + samples (do **not** commit `store.json`)
- `backend/` — FastAPI + Alembic + Signal Score services

Path alias: `@/*` → `./src/*` (web).

## Canonical files

- Types: `web/src/lib/types.ts`
- Taxonomy SoT: `web/src/lib/taxonomy.ts` (not `taxonomy.json`)
- Detect / ingest / eval / format / store: matching files in `web/src/lib/`
- Detect v2 (hybrid): `web/src/lib/detect-llm.ts` — heuristics first; Groq only on misses; off without `DETECT_LLM=1` + `GROQ_API_KEY`
- Agent project state: `.cursor/docs/PROJECT_STATE.md` (update on milestones)
- Signal Score client: `web/src/lib/backend-client.ts`
- Backend models/services: `backend/app/`
- Tokens + utilities: `web/src/app/globals.css`
- Chrome: `web/src/components/AppShell.tsx`

## Patterns

- RSC pages read the store directly; mutations via `fetch` to `/api/*` then `router.refresh()`
- Data pages: `export const dynamic = "force-dynamic"`
- Detect/ingest dual-write predictions to FastAPI (`backendSignalId` on signals; upsert on tenant+conversation+type; multi-retry + short backoff + `predictionSync` stats)
- Insights pending queue: `fetchNeedsReview` → join via `join-needs-review.ts` (not JSON `status===new` as SoT)
- Feedback proxies to FastAPI (`correct` / `incorrect` / `partially_correct`) and mirrors into JSON for reviewed filter / detail
